@startuml
title v1.7 Teaching Output Production
actor Lecturer
participant "Unified Web Area" as Web
participant "Conversation API" as API
participant "Module Context Service" as MCS
participant "Assessment Safety" as Safety
participant "AI Gateway" as AI
database PostgreSQL as DB
Lecturer -> Web: Prompt + optional module offering
Web -> API: POST message
API -> MCS: resolve authorised context
MCS -> DB: read offering/outcomes/assignment
MCS --> API: immutable context bundle
API -> Safety: enforce generation role
API -> AI: provider-neutral production prompt
AI --> API: generated Markdown
API -> Safety: evaluate version 1
Safety --> API: risk/status/warnings
API -> DB: persist message, output, version, lifecycle, review
API --> Web: inline output + controls
@enduml
